                scoped to <code class="font-mono text-[0.82rem] bg-ink/[0.04] text-ink px-1.5 rounded-[4px]">current_account</code>,
                grouped (Custom Rules, Rate Plans, Facilities, Accounts, Jump-to), debounced at
                150 ms, rendered via a native
                <code class="font-mono text-[0.82rem] bg-ink/[0.04] text-ink px-1.5 rounded-[4px]">&lt;dialog&gt;</code> with HTMX.
                Deliberate constraint: the palette
                <strong class="text-ink font-semibold">does not replace per-page search</strong>.
