                  <span>Density toggle persisted on the user record, read pre-paint from
                    <code class="font-mono text-[0.82rem] bg-ink/[0.04] text-ink px-1.5 rounded-[4px]">&lt;head&gt;</code> to avoid FOUC.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">
                  <Icon name="ph:check-circle" size={18} class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-accent" />
